WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

00:00.990 --> 00:06.930
Just like the cruel angel

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

00:06.930 --> 00:14.590
Young boy, become a legend

00:18.990 --> 00:22.410
2D4U PRESENTS:

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Aoi kaze ga ima

00:22.770 --> 00:25.810
Even though the untested breeze...

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
mune no doa o tataitemo

00:25.810 --> 00:29.510
...taps at the door to your heart

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

00:29.510 --> 00:36.970
You just look solely at me and smile

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

00:37.560 --> 00:44.500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

00:44.500 --> 00:51.400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

00:52.000 --> 00:55.750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
sono senaka ni wa

00:55.750 --> 00:58.340
...that upon your back

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

00:59.510 --> 01:02.960
You have the wings with which to fly...

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
no hane ga aru koto

01:02.960 --> 01:06.310
...towards the distant future

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

01:06.990 --> 01:10.690
The cruel angel's thesis

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

01:10.690 --> 01:14.430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

01:14.430 --> 01:18.200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
Omoide o uragiru nara

01:18.200 --> 01:21.900
If you are to betray our memories

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

01:21.900 --> 01:25.540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

01:25.540 --> 01:29.270
Young boy, become a legend

01:30.400 --> 01:31.860
THE YEAR IS 2015 A.D.

01:31.940 --> 01:32.860
THIRD ANGEL

01:36.780 --> 01:37.990
SACHIEL ATTACKS

01:48.420 --> 01:51.380
ORDINARY WEAPONS PROVE
INEFFECTIVE AGAINST THE ANGEL

01:51.460 --> 01:53.880
THE OPERATION IS ABANDONED
BY THE MILITARY

01:53.960 --> 01:55.630
TRANSFERS ALL COMMAND TO
SPECIAL DUTY ORGANIZATION "NERV"

01:55.720 --> 01:58.130
LATE THAT NIGHT,
THE ANGEL ARRIVES DIRECTLY
ABOVE NERV HEADQUARTERS

01:58.220 --> 01:59.640
SEIZED THAT DAY WAS

01:59.720 --> 02:01.140
THIRD CHILD
THE THIRD QUALIFIED INDIVIDUAL

02:03.180 --> 02:04.890
SHINJI IKARI

02:04.970 --> 02:06.390
ACCEPTS PILOTING DUTY

02:06.480 --> 02:08.650
EVANGELION UNIT 01
FIRST LAUNCH

02:18.910 --> 02:20.870
NERV EXPERIENCES ITS FIRST ACTUAL BATTLE

02:20.950 --> 02:22.700
FIRST DIRECTLY-OVERHEAD ENCOUNTER

02:37.920 --> 02:40.430
EVA UNIT 01, CRANIAL AREA DAMAGED,
RENDERED INOPERABLE

02:42.430 --> 02:43.850
COMPLETE SILENCE

02:43.930 --> 02:44.350
THEN,

02:47.890 --> 02:49.020
LOSS OF CONTROL

02:49.480 --> 02:54.570
"New Tokyo-3 Urban Combat"
Interim Report
Person in Charge
Chief of Operations Captain Misato Katsuragi

02:49.520 --> 02:53.940
<i>Although, as a result, the damage
we incurred was extensive,</i>

02:53.940 --> 02:55.900
<i>the fact is that, against an unknown target,</i>

02:54.690 --> 02:56.400
AND WITH THE THIRD ANGEL AND UNIT 01

02:55.900 --> 03:00.700
<i>a boy with zero experience went out on
his first battle and soundly defeated it.</i>

02:58.530 --> 03:00.450
THE CONFIRMATION OF AN AT FIELD

03:00.700 --> 03:04.450
<i>Shinji Ikari's achievement is
deserving of special notice.</i>

03:04.490 --> 03:07.200
UNIT 01 ERODES TARGET'S AT FIELD

03:07.540 --> 03:11.750
<i>However, for the Department of Operations,
it further highlighted areas of concern</i>

03:11.750 --> 03:15.210
<i>and turned into a bitter battle, the execution
of which left much to be desired.</i>

03:16.300 --> 03:17.760
ANGEL DESTROYED

03:20.800 --> 03:24.260
COUNTERATTACK FACILITIES PARTIALLY DAMAGED
EVA UNIT-01 MODERATELY DAMAGED

03:28.890 --> 03:31.600
EXISTENCE OF VICTIMS OF THIS INCIDENT
NEVER PUBLICIZED

03:32.100 --> 03:35.270
<i>My kid sister's only in the second grade.</i>

03:32.310 --> 03:49.870
Excerpt from Toji Suzuhara's essay

03:35.270 --> 03:37.360
<i>She got hurt in that mess the other day.</i>

03:37.360 --> 03:40.450
<i>And hurt from our side goin' crazy,
not the enemy!</i>

03:40.450 --> 03:43.870
<i>I can't believe how stupid that was.
It's unforgivable!</i>

03:43.870 --> 03:46.030
<i>I'd like to show the adult who made that robot</i>

03:46.030 --> 03:49.870
<i>my sister's sufferin' and my anger!</i>

03:51.500 --> 03:52.710
FOURTH ANGEL

03:55.920 --> 03:57.880
SHAMSHEL ATTACKS

04:03.840 --> 04:07.560
AT THE TIME, GROUND-TO-AIR INTERCEPT SYSTEM
OPERATING AT 48.2%

04:07.640 --> 04:11.020
NEW TOKYO-3
96.8% SWITCHED TO BATTLE CONFIGURATION

04:11.480 --> 04:15.520
<i>I had evacuation drills at school and stuff
all the time with my friends,</i>

04:11.730 --> 04:23.820
Hikari Horiki's note (partial)

04:15.520 --> 04:18.400
<i>So by then it wasn't a big deal
or anything to worry about.</i>

04:18.400 --> 04:21.190
<i>The guys were all acting up
like they were on a field trip,</i>

04:21.190 --> 04:23.820
<i>And none of the girls were afraid either.</i>

04:27.370 --> 04:30.160
ANGEL ARRIVES IN NEW TOKYO-3 AIRSPACE

04:34.250 --> 04:36.040
SECOND DIRECTLY-OVERHEAD ENCOUNTER

04:49.430 --> 04:53.350
SUFFERS ACCIDENT, DISCONNECTED FROM
EXTERNAL POWER SOURCE, HOWEVER...

05:01.530 --> 05:02.990
ANGEL DESTROYED

05:06.740 --> 05:10.200
NERV OBTAINS ANGEL SAMPLE
STILL IN ORIGINAL SHAPE

05:11.660 --> 05:15.460
HOWEVER, A FINAL REPORT ON THE
ANALYSIS RESULTS HAS YET TO BE FILED

05:15.540 --> 05:16.710
FIFTH ANGEL

05:23.590 --> 05:25.050
RAMIEL ATTACKS

05:25.130 --> 05:26.760
AGAINST THIS IMPREGNABLE TARGET,

05:26.840 --> 05:30.390
CAPTAIN KATSURAGI PROPOSES
OPERATION YASHIMA, WHICH IS APPROVED

05:30.470 --> 05:32.140
FIRST CHILD
FIRST QUALIFIED INDIVIDUAL

05:32.180 --> 05:35.180
DESIGNATED PILOT OF EVA UNIT 00

05:38.060 --> 05:39.980
REI AYANAMI

05:40.020 --> 05:44.240
LAUNCHES FOR THE FIRST TIME IN EVA
UNIT 00 RELEASED FROM CRYOGENIC FREEZE

05:46.240 --> 05:49.700
LATE THAT NIGHT, A PART OF THE ANGEL
INVADES THE GEO-FRONT

05:52.830 --> 05:55.290
NERV DECISIVELY EXECUTES
OPERATION YASHIMA

05:55.290 --> 05:57.830
<i>Ikari didn't tell me anything, but...</i>

05:55.500 --> 06:13.390
Excerpt from Kensuke Aida's personal materials

05:57.830 --> 06:01.380
<i>I think Unit 00 bravely interposed herself
to protect Unit 01</i>

06:01.380 --> 06:03.960
<i>from the enemy's particle beam attack.</i>

06:03.960 --> 06:06.880
<i>No, I'm certain of it.</i>

06:06.880 --> 06:10.340
<i>There's just one reason for that,
and that's Ayanami.</i>

06:10.800 --> 06:15.100
<i>Because she seems to hold little respect
for her own existence.</i>

06:13.760 --> 06:15.470
OPERATION YASHIMA EXECUTED
SUCCESSFULLY

06:16.730 --> 06:21.440
I think it's not quite pessimism, but
she already has something about her.

06:16.770 --> 06:18.480
EVA UNIT 00 HEAVILY DAMAGED

06:19.850 --> 06:22.270
HOWEVER, PILOT RETURNS SAFELY

06:21.440 --> 06:24.110
I find it hard to believe that she's
the same age as we are.

06:25.780 --> 06:26.990
SIXTH ANGEL

06:29.410 --> 06:31.370
ENCOUNTER WITH GAGHIEL

06:31.780 --> 06:34.950
This incident deviated slightly from our script.

06:34.950 --> 06:38.080
Nevertheless, the result was within
the projected parameters.

06:38.080 --> 06:39.710
We can make the necessary adjustments.

06:39.750 --> 06:41.460
SECOND CHILD
SECOND QUALIFIED INDIVIDUAL

06:41.500 --> 06:44.380
DESIGNATED PILOT OF EVA UNIT 02

06:44.880 --> 06:48.300
ASUKA LANGLEY SOHRYU

06:48.340 --> 06:51.050
FIRST LAUNCH ABOARD EVA UNIT 02

06:53.640 --> 06:55.350
CLOSE QUARTERS COMBAT AT SEA

07:03.480 --> 07:04.190
AND

07:08.360 --> 07:10.320
FIRST UNDERWATER BATTLE

07:18.700 --> 07:20.670
IN AN ENGAGEMENT OFF THE SHORE OF OLD LTOH

07:30.340 --> 07:31.760
ANGEL DESTROYED

07:31.760 --> 07:37.600
The UN Navy lost a third of its
entire fleet in this encounter.

07:37.600 --> 07:42.310
Those ships belonged to your country.
In reality, it's a trivial loss.

07:42.310 --> 07:47.110
Indeed, it's quite fortunate that
the damage was so minor.

07:47.150 --> 07:48.360
SEVENTH ANGEL

07:50.700 --> 07:52.660
ISRAFEL ATTACKS

07:58.910 --> 08:01.120
FIRST ANGEL TO USE DIVIDING
AND MERGING ABILITIES

08:10.090 --> 08:14.050
HOWEVER, WITH THE HEAVY SIMULTANEOUS
2-POINT ATTACK BY EVA UNIT 01 AND UNIT 02

08:25.270 --> 08:26.730
ANGEL DESTROYED

08:31.690 --> 08:32.900
EIGHTH ANGEL

08:35.200 --> 08:38.160
SANDALPHON DISCOVERED
WITHIN MT. ASAMA CRATER

08:39.120 --> 08:41.410
NERV ISSUES ORDER A-17

08:41.500 --> 08:45.370
PRIORITIZED ABOVE ALL ELSE, THE FIRST
CAPTURE OPERATION IS DEPLOYED

08:53.170 --> 08:56.090
CONFINED BRIEFLY IN THE ELECTROMAGNETIC
OPTICAL WAVE ENCLOSURE,
BUT...

09:00.180 --> 09:03.140
THE ELECTROMAGNETIC MEMBRANE IS TORN TO
SHREDS AND THE OPERATION IS INTERRUPTED

09:03.180 --> 09:06.650
OPERATION OBJECTIVE IS IMMEDIATELY
CHANGED TO DESTROYING THE ANGEL

09:14.030 --> 09:16.490
EVA UNIT 02 EXECUTES OPERATION

09:21.700 --> 09:23.120
ANGEL DESTROYED

09:23.160 --> 09:27.000
EVA UNIT-00 RESTORED FROM DAMAGE
AND MODIFICATION WORK COMPLETE

09:28.040 --> 09:29.250
BACK ON DUTY

09:29.340 --> 09:30.460
NINTH ANGEL

09:35.010 --> 09:36.970
MATARAEL ATTACKS

09:44.770 --> 09:48.100
THE FIRST OPERATION WITH ALL THREE EVAS
DEPLOYED AT THE SAME TIME

09:57.280 --> 09:58.740
ANGEL DESTROYED

09:58.780 --> 09:59.950
TENTH ANGEL

10:04.160 --> 10:05.620
SAHAQUIEL ATTACKS

10:06.910 --> 10:09.540
AGAINST THE TARGET FLYING IN
FROM THE STRATOSPHERE

10:16.220 --> 10:19.180
THROUGH DIRECT INTERCEPTION BY THE 3 EVAS

10:40.070 --> 10:41.530
ANGEL DESTROYED

10:41.570 --> 10:42.830
ELEVENTH ANGEL

10:42.870 --> 10:44.790
FACTS CONCERNING THE ATTACK
ARE CURRENTLY UNCONFIRMED

10:44.830 --> 10:48.040
WILD RUMOR OF A DIRECT INVASION
OF NERV HEADQUARTERS

10:45.870 --> 10:47.710
This is no good.

10:48.120 --> 10:50.540
HUMAN INSTRUMENTALITY COMMITTEE
SPECIAL MEETING CONVENED

10:48.250 --> 10:49.420
It's happening too early.

10:49.420 --> 10:50.540
Indeed!

10:50.540 --> 10:54.800
An Angel invading Nerv HQ
was outside of our schedule.

10:54.800 --> 10:58.340
And worse, to think that you let it
intrude into Central Dogma.

10:58.340 --> 11:00.300
If contact had occurred then,

11:00.300 --> 11:03.390
our entire project could have ended in disaster.

11:03.390 --> 11:06.140
The report to this committee was in error.

11:06.140 --> 11:08.730
No Angel invasion took place.

11:08.730 --> 11:14.270
Ikari, are you then saying the Eleventh Angel's
intrusion did not occur?

11:15.020 --> 11:16.030
Yes.

11:16.030 --> 11:18.320
Speak with caution, Ikari.

11:18.320 --> 11:21.490
Making false statements to this conference
is punishable by death.

11:21.490 --> 11:24.990
You are free to examine the Magi's recorders.

11:24.990 --> 11:27.240
There is no evidence of any such incident.

11:27.240 --> 11:31.960
This is absurd. Hiding the truth is your specialty.

11:31.960 --> 11:36.170
The time schedule is advancing as described
in the Dead Sea Scrolls.

11:36.170 --> 11:37.840
Fine then.

11:37.840 --> 11:41.090
We'll leave aside the matter of crimes
or responsibility on your part.

11:42.550 --> 11:46.470
But there is no need for you
to create a new script.

11:47.260 --> 11:49.180
I realize that.

11:49.480 --> 11:52.900
Everything is proceeding
according to Seele's script.

11:52.940 --> 11:56.320
CHAPTER FOURTEEN
SEELE, THRONE OF SOULS

12:02.570 --> 12:03.910
Mountain...

12:03.910 --> 12:05.490
Heavy mountains.

12:05.490 --> 12:07.740
Things that change over time.

12:09.750 --> 12:11.210
Sky...

12:11.210 --> 12:12.790
Blue sky.

12:13.120 --> 12:15.040
What your eyes can't see.

12:15.500 --> 12:17.420
What your eyes can see.

12:18.750 --> 12:20.010
Sun...

12:20.010 --> 12:21.760
A unique object.

12:22.130 --> 12:23.430
Water...

12:23.430 --> 12:25.390
Something comforting.

12:25.390 --> 12:27.180
Commander Ikari?

12:27.180 --> 12:28.350
Flowers...

12:28.350 --> 12:30.390
So many of the same.

12:30.390 --> 12:32.770
And so many unneeded.

12:32.770 --> 12:34.230
Sky...

12:34.230 --> 12:36.900
Red, red sky.

12:36.900 --> 12:38.360
The color red.

12:38.360 --> 12:40.400
I hate the color red.

12:40.400 --> 12:41.690
Water flowing.

12:41.690 --> 12:43.280
Blood...

12:43.280 --> 12:44.530
The smell of blood.

12:44.530 --> 12:46.740
A woman who never bleeds.

12:46.740 --> 12:49.700
Man made from red soil.

12:49.700 --> 12:52.540
Man made from man and woman.

12:53.120 --> 12:56.460
City... A human creation.

12:56.460 --> 12:59.750
Eva... A human creation.

12:59.750 --> 13:03.670
What is a human? A creation of God?

13:03.670 --> 13:06.180
Is man a human creation?

13:06.180 --> 13:09.260
The things I possess are life and soul.

13:09.260 --> 13:10.930
I am a vessel for a soul.

13:10.930 --> 13:14.440
Entry plug, the throne for a soul.

13:14.690 --> 13:17.770
Who is this? This is me.

13:17.770 --> 13:25.110
Who am I? What am I? What am I?
What am I? What am I?

13:25.110 --> 13:26.740
I am myself.

13:26.740 --> 13:28.910
This object is me.

13:28.910 --> 13:31.540
The form that shapes me.

13:31.540 --> 13:35.910
This is the me that can be seen,
yet I feel as though I am not myself.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.620
Very strange.

13:37.620 --> 13:39.960
I feel as if my body is melting.

13:39.960 --> 13:44.470
I can no longer see myself.
My shape is fading.

13:44.470 --> 13:47.050
I feel the presence of someone who is not me.

13:47.050 --> 13:50.260
Is someone there, beyond this?

13:50.800 --> 13:52.010
Ikari?

13:52.010 --> 13:54.730
I know this person. Major Katsuragi.

13:54.930 --> 13:56.480
Doctor Akagi.

13:56.480 --> 13:57.690
Everyone.

13:57.690 --> 13:58.730
Classmates.

13:58.730 --> 14:00.520
The pilot of Unit 02.

14:00.860 --> 14:02.650
Commander Ikari?

14:02.650 --> 14:03.860
Who are you?

14:03.900 --> 14:05.360
Who are you?

14:05.360 --> 14:06.860
Who are you?

14:08.410 --> 14:11.780
So, Rei, how does it feel to be piloting
Unit 01 for the first time?

14:13.540 --> 14:15.120
It smells like Ikari.

14:15.160 --> 14:19.120
FIRST UNIT INTERCHANGEABILITY TEST
SUBJECT REI AYANAMI

14:19.670 --> 14:23.460
Her synch rate is almost the same
as with Unit 00.

14:23.460 --> 14:27.510
Unit 00 and 01's personal data patterns
are very similar too, after all.

14:27.510 --> 14:29.930
That's exactly what makes this
synchronization possible.

14:30.640 --> 14:34.930
Error is plus or minus 0.03.
Harmonics are normal.

14:35.560 --> 14:39.400
No interchangeability problems detected
between Rei and Unit 01.

14:39.400 --> 14:41.060
Okay, the test is finished.

14:41.060 --> 14:43.900
Rei, you can get out now.

14:43.900 --> 14:45.570
Yes, Ma'am.

14:50.820 --> 14:54.790
87TH UNIT LINK-UP TEST
SUBJECT ASUKA LANGLEY SOHRYU

14:55.580 --> 14:57.500
Data bank for Unit 02 complete.

14:57.500 --> 14:59.620
Harmonics are all normal.

14:59.620 --> 15:01.540
Pilot status normal.

15:01.540 --> 15:02.790
Of course!

15:02.840 --> 15:06.630
FIRST UNIT INTERCHANGEABILITY TEST
SUBJECT SHINJI IKARI

15:06.380 --> 15:08.380
Entry plug insertion complete.

15:08.380 --> 15:10.680
What about Unit 00's personal data?

15:10.680 --> 15:14.100
Already reconfigured. Currently reconfirming.

15:14.970 --> 15:16.220
Subject status?

15:16.220 --> 15:19.770
He appears a bit nervous, but no problems
in his nerve patterns.

15:20.230 --> 15:22.310
This is his first time in Unit 00.

15:22.310 --> 15:24.730
It's another Eva, so it's only natural.

15:25.480 --> 15:29.610
He's so stupid. He should just take it easy
and not worry about those things.

15:29.990 --> 15:33.030
Shinji's just not that kind of person.

15:33.030 --> 15:35.280
I know, that's why he's stupid.

15:36.990 --> 15:42.000
Speaking of which, don't I need to be involved
in their interchangeability test?

15:42.460 --> 15:45.790
You don't want to pilot an Eva
besides Unit 02 anyway, do you?

15:46.090 --> 15:48.670
Well, you've got that right.

15:49.260 --> 15:52.970
Eva Unit 02 definitely
wouldn't be interchangeable.

15:53.590 --> 15:55.800
Entry has commenced.

15:55.800 --> 15:57.350
LCL electrolyzed.

15:57.350 --> 15:59.730
Initiating first connection.

15:59.730 --> 16:03.020
Shinji, how do you feel in Unit 00's entry plug?

16:03.020 --> 16:05.270
It feels kind of odd.

16:05.270 --> 16:06.730
A sense of incongruity?

16:06.730 --> 16:08.570
No, it's just that...

16:08.570 --> 16:10.530
It smells like Ayanami.

16:10.530 --> 16:13.360
What does he mean, smell? Is he a pervert?

16:13.360 --> 16:16.070
Data received. Reconfirming. Pattern green.

16:16.070 --> 16:17.830
Main power supply connection complete.

16:17.830 --> 16:19.580
All restraints are normal.

16:19.580 --> 16:20.910
Roger.

16:20.910 --> 16:23.790
Now let's shift to the second stage
of the interchangeability tests.

16:23.790 --> 16:26.540
Unit 00 will enter into second contact.

16:26.710 --> 16:27.710
How is it?

16:27.710 --> 16:30.670
As I thought, the synch rate is lower
than that of Unit 01.

16:31.340 --> 16:33.760
Harmonics are all normal.

16:33.760 --> 16:35.340
But these are still good readings.

16:35.890 --> 16:39.260
This means we can implement that plan.

16:39.260 --> 16:40.930
The dummy system, you mean?

16:40.930 --> 16:43.850
I know you support it, but I'm not so...

16:43.850 --> 16:45.810
I understand why you wouldn't approve,

16:45.810 --> 16:50.610
but we always need to be prepared
so that mankind can survive.

16:50.610 --> 16:53.950
I highly respect you, Ma'am,
and I will do my duty,

16:53.950 --> 16:55.910
but I am not convinced about this project.

16:55.910 --> 16:58.280
It's tough having a fastidious nature,

16:58.280 --> 17:00.370
as far as living among people goes.

17:00.910 --> 17:04.290
You'll understand that when
you feel that you've been sullied.

17:10.170 --> 17:12.550
Initiating third connection.

17:12.550 --> 17:15.380
Self psycho-graph is stable.

17:15.380 --> 17:19.560
Hey, Shin, how do you like mommy's breast?
Or is it more like inside her womb?

17:19.560 --> 17:22.430
Asuka, it'll introduce data noise. Don't interfere.

17:22.430 --> 17:23.640
Okay, okay.

17:24.230 --> 17:27.600
What's with them? They're all so quick
to mollycoddle Shinji.

17:27.900 --> 17:30.230
Initiate A-10 nerve connection.

17:30.230 --> 17:32.360
Harmonics level, plus twenty.

17:33.490 --> 17:35.110
What is this?

17:35.110 --> 17:39.580
Something's trying to get directly into my brain.

17:40.370 --> 17:42.370
Ayanami?

17:43.040 --> 17:44.870
Rei Ayanami?

17:44.870 --> 17:47.460
This impression is Rei Ayanami, isn't it?

17:49.420 --> 17:51.460
Ayanami?

17:51.460 --> 17:52.710
Isn't it her?

17:57.180 --> 17:57.970
What's going on?

17:57.970 --> 17:59.850
We've got a problem occurring
in the pilot's nerve pulse.

17:59.850 --> 18:00.720
Pulse reversing!

18:00.720 --> 18:02.390
Mental contamination is taking place.

18:02.390 --> 18:05.180
Impossible! That can't happen
at this plug depth.

18:05.180 --> 18:06.390
It's not from the plug.

18:06.390 --> 18:07.940
The intrusion's coming from the Eva.

18:16.450 --> 18:18.450
Unit 00 is out of control!

18:21.700 --> 18:23.450
Shut off all circuits! Cut the power supply!

18:29.540 --> 18:32.000
Eva has switched to backup power.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.880
Still operational.

18:33.880 --> 18:34.760
How's Shinji?

18:34.760 --> 18:37.050
The circuit's disconnected.
We can't monitor him!

18:37.050 --> 18:39.260
Unit 00 is rejecting Shinji?

18:39.260 --> 18:42.300
It's no good! The auto eject's not working!

18:42.300 --> 18:44.680
The same thing as before...

18:44.680 --> 18:46.310
Is it going to try to absorb Shinji?

18:53.070 --> 18:55.280
Rei, get back! Rei!

18:54.270 --> 18:58.070
Activation will be terminated in ten...

18:58.070 --> 18:58.950
9...

18:58.950 --> 18:59.740
8...

18:59.740 --> 19:00.570
7...

19:00.570 --> 19:01.410
6...

19:01.410 --> 19:02.200
5...

19:02.200 --> 19:02.990
4...

19:02.990 --> 19:03.740
3...

19:03.740 --> 19:04.490
2...

19:04.490 --> 19:05.290
1...

19:05.290 --> 19:06.410
Zero!

19:08.000 --> 19:10.710
Unit 00 has ceased activation.

19:10.710 --> 19:12.830
Hurry up and rescue the pilot!

19:13.920 --> 19:17.880
Could it be that Unit 00 just tried to kill Rei?

19:21.130 --> 19:24.510
Was this somehow related to
the earlier berserk incident

19:24.510 --> 19:26.430
when Rei was the pilot?

19:26.430 --> 19:29.060
I can't tell you anything right now.

19:29.060 --> 19:32.810
I only know we must reconfigure Unit 00
for Rei's personal data,

19:32.810 --> 19:35.070
and run a new synch test between them
as soon as possible.

19:35.070 --> 19:38.740
As Chief of Operations, I ask that you do so
as soon as possible,

19:38.740 --> 19:40.860
before it impacts our work.

19:40.860 --> 19:43.200
I know, Major Katsuragi.

19:51.580 --> 19:56.550
The person Unit 00 wanted to hit was me.
I'm sure of it.

19:57.300 --> 19:59.800
<i><i>And now the next contestant</i></i>

19:59.800 --> 20:03.300
<i><i>for the World's Most Amazing Exhibition is,
Math Puppy!</i></i>

20:03.300 --> 20:04.470
<i><i>Wow, that sounds awesome!</i></i>

20:04.470 --> 20:08.390
<i><i>Here we go, math genius puppy,
Kana, from Niigata!</i></i>

20:08.390 --> 20:09.060
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

20:09.060 --> 20:11.770
<i><i>He sounds good. Do you understand me?</i></i>

20:11.770 --> 20:12.350
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

20:12.350 --> 20:16.770
<i><i>Oh, right. Now let's ask him.</i></i>

20:16.770 --> 20:17.650
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

20:17.650 --> 20:21.490
<i><i>What is 325 minus 324?</i></i>

20:21.490 --> 20:22.400
<i><i>Wan!</i></i>

20:22.400 --> 20:24.780
<i><i>That's amazing! He's correct!</i></i>

20:24.780 --> 20:27.120
I hate it. It's this ceiling again.

20:28.240 --> 20:32.330
Shinji has regained consciousness.
No signs of mental contamination.

20:32.790 --> 20:35.670
He doesn't appear to remember anything.

20:36.590 --> 20:37.210
I see.

20:37.210 --> 20:39.670
<i><i>Hi! I'm doing fine,</i></i>

20:39.670 --> 20:43.180
<i><i>but the world is worrisome due to
terrorism in the Nansa Islands.</i></i>

20:41.590 --> 20:45.010
Misato and Mr. Kaji won't tell me,

20:43.180 --> 20:47.640
<i><i>This year long heat creates some crazy
bastards, you know?</i></i>

20:45.010 --> 20:48.640
And Shinji doesn't even know.

20:47.640 --> 20:50.350
<i><i>What I can't stand is those suicidal idiots
that involve innocent people!</i></i>

20:48.640 --> 20:50.350
Just what kind of girl is the First Child?

20:51.810 --> 20:53.270
The Angel invasion that deviated from the plan.

20:53.020 --> 20:53.850
Knight

20:53.270 --> 20:54.270
The Angel invasion that deviated from the plan.

20:54.270 --> 20:58.650
So the Human Instrumentality Committee is
taking advantage of having learned of it.

20:58.650 --> 21:03.780
Though they're just worthless fools whose job
is to do nothing but complain.

21:04.320 --> 21:09.330
We hold all the trump cards.
There is nothing they can do.

21:09.330 --> 21:11.910
Still, that doesn't mean we should provoke them.

21:12.410 --> 21:16.790
If Seele starts interfering now, it'll be trouble,
in more ways than one.

21:16.790 --> 21:19.750
Everything is going according to our script.

21:19.750 --> 21:21.760
There is no problem.

21:21.760 --> 21:26.180
What about the Unit 00 accident?
That wasn't in my script.

21:26.180 --> 21:27.720
It is no obstacle.

21:28.300 --> 21:32.180
The re-synchronization test for Rei
and Unit 00 was successful.

21:32.180 --> 21:35.140
Ikari is too concerned about Rei.

21:35.140 --> 21:37.440
What is the status of the Adam Project?

21:37.440 --> 21:40.110
Proceeding smoothly. It's not even
two percent behind schedule.

21:40.110 --> 21:42.570
Then, the Lance of Longinus is...

21:42.570 --> 21:43.740
It's going as planned.

21:43.740 --> 21:45.400
Rei is carrying out the operation.

21:57.420 --> 22:00.630
TO BE CONTINUED

23:06.070 --> 23:06.990
PREVIEW

23:07.320 --> 23:09.860
With her friends getting married
one after another,

23:09.860 --> 23:11.990
Misato alone begins to get worked up.

23:11.990 --> 23:16.580
Could the reunion between her and Kaji
be her last chance?

23:16.950 --> 23:19.410
Next episode: "Lies and Silence"

23:18.710 --> 23:21.040
LIES AND SILENCE
